%% dataflow.mmd — sequence for 'open paper -> show chunks -> summarize'
sequenceDiagram
  participant U as User
  participant P as PapersCard (hook usePapers)
  participant API as FastAPI
  participant N as normalizePaper/normalizeChunk
  participant C as ChunkList

  U->>P: open app /health/papers
  P->>API: GET /api/papers?t=...
  API-->>P: { papers: [...] }
  P->>N: normalizePaper(...)
  N-->>P: normalized papers
  U->>P: select paper
  P->>API: GET /api/papers?paper_id=...
  API-->>P: { chunks: [...] }
  P->>N: normalizeChunk(...)
  N-->>C: chunk list
